  40:    The claim that the columns are â€œinvisibleâ€ because they are not in a new grant is false ([design:40](C:/Users/yerie/m3-memory/docs/MUSEUM_CONTRIBUTOR_CAPABILITY_DESIGN.md:40), [design:83](C:/Users/yerie/m3-memory/docs/MUSEUM_CONTRIBUTOR_CAPABILITY_DESIGN.md:83), [design:98](C:/Users/yerie/m3-memory/docs/MUSEUM_CONTRIBUTOR_CAPABILITY_DESIGN.md:98)). The schema already grants table-level `SELECT` on `submissions` to `authenticated` ([schema.sql:148](C:/Users/yerie/m3-memory/supabase/schema.sql:148)-[151](C:/Users/yerie/m3-memory/supabase/schema.sql:151)). RLS restricts rows to admins, but authenticated admins can select all columns.
